## DELETE /v1/products

```json
{ "siteId": "my_store", "products": [{ "productId": "430738", "updatedDate": "2026-04-01T10:10:00Z" }] }
```

Idempotent. Deleting a product removes all its market data automatically.

---

## POST /v1/markets

Send Add products **first**, then Add markets.

```json
{
  "siteId": "my_store",
  "markets": [{ "marketId": "ca", "products": [...] }]
}
```

### Market product fields

| Field         | Required | `null` behavior          |
|---------------|----------|--------------------------|
| `productId`   | Yes      | —                        |
| `updatedDate` | Yes      | —                        |
| `price`       | No       | **Invalid**              |
| `currency`    | No       | **Invalid**              |
| `isInStock`   | No       | **Invalid**              |
| `oldPrice`    | No       | Clears market oldPrice   |
| `urls`        | No       | Clears all market URLs   |

`urls` is a dict: `{ "en": "https://...", "fr": "https://..." }`. Set locale to `null` to clear only that locale.

Market record is active in recommendations only when base product exists **and** market has `price` + `currency` + `isInStock`.

---

## Response format

```json
{
  "requestId": "...",
  "summary": { "received": 3, "accepted": 2, "rejected": 1 },
  "items": [{ "productId": "...", "status": "rejected", "code": "MISSING_REQUIRED_FIELD", "message": "..." }]
}
```

HTTP: `200` all ok · `207` partial · `400` bad payload · `409` language mismatch · `413` too large · `429` rate limit · `500+` server error (retry with backoff)

## Key error codes

| Code                     | Level | Cause |
|--------------------------|-------|-------|
| `LANGUAGE_CODE_MISMATCH` | 409   | Wrong `languageCode` without `languageChanged: true` |
| `MISSING_REQUIRED_FIELD` | 207   | Required field absent |
| `INVALID_URL`            | 207   | Non-absolute or malformed URL |
| `INVALID_CURRENCY`       | 207   | Not valid ISO 4217 |
| `INVALID_PRICE`          | 207   | `oldPrice <= price` |
| `INVALID_NULL_FIELD`     | 207   | `null` sent for non-nullable market field |
| `EMPTY_MARKET_PATCH`     | 207   | Market item has no fields to change |
| `DUPLICATE_KEY_IN_BATCH` | 207   | Same `productId` twice in one request |
| `BATCH_SIZE_EXCEEDED`    | 413   | > 1,000 items |
| `RATE_LIMITED`           | 429   | Rate limit hit |

